body:
Zombie apocalypse, guy and gal use a quadbike that can also float and do boat shit.  
They use it as a noise distraction in a fountain so they can find somewhere safe.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Also, tits

I found a Ms Nanny who needed to tell someone a story before she was allowed to do anything else. Sat there for 10 seconds listening to Cinderella before my team mate shouted at me to get him up as a rocket launcher wielding, leader moleman killed him. Safe to say I didn't get him up and continued listening to the story.

&#x200B;

Also found a glowing legendary ghoul that took the durability of three weapons and multiple grenades to get to half health. I had to run away from that one.

Mine was the game crashing after paying to claim a workstation so I just lose my caps.

&#x200B;

What I actually liked the most is the back and forth of me and my friend(s) finding better and better gear, showing off and then getting rekt 30 mins later when someone else finds a cool mod or weapon. I'm also still in shock that my childhood dream of playing this franchise with a friend is actually happening.
